   $q$What action does the author want the park board to take?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Ban families from visiting the pond on warm weekends.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"Close the picnic areas where bread feeding is heaviest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"not-in-text"},{"text":"Remove some of the geese that have crowded the pond.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"not-in-text"},{"text":"Post signs asking visitors not to feed bread to the birds.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Post signs asking visitors not to feed bread to the birds.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says the board "should post signs asking visitors not to feed bread to the birds." The author wants families to keep visiting and even suggests other foods they can offer.$q$, 'draft', '4347f33f-951e-5cbd-95ac-5e1953240d65')
